      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "'Easter, 1960s'\n\nIt's dark and cold, but the sky is clear. We walk in
    silence to the curch on the hill. Our steps sound loud on the path. \nThe church
    smells of resin and old wooden beams. The priest lights his candle. Then he passes
    the flame along. My candle catches the little flame, small but bright, and suddenly
    I can see everyone's faces in that warm glow. \nWe walk back to the village with
    hundreds of tiny flames. It looks as if the stars have descended to walk with
    us. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e981119c4fb8360468cb3e2f08c2f99f, type: 2}
