--- !u!114 &1358812709
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1358812707}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "'Winter 1944'\n\nI am sitting behind the shed, my knees pulled to my chest.
    The snow crunches when someone walks on it. It's the Germans, everyone says we
    must be afraid. \nBut the soldier who opens our door doesn't look angry. He even
    bows a little. \nHe holds out a chocolate bar so big I have to take it with both
    hands. \nHe also sets down a pair of boots, brown dar too big. \nMy mother squeezes
    my shoulder, but I don't dare say a word. The air smells of smoke and iron. My
    heart beats so loudly I think he might hear. "
