  m_text: "\u201C\n.....\r\nAfter collecting all those pages, I feel like i got to
    learn more about Tanti Iana and the village. But her being gone now\u2026 there
    is a hole next to my house. There is no one there. What happens to villages like
    this when everyone is gone? \nWhat other stories are we missing when villages
    disappear?\r\n\u201C\r\n"
