  m_text: "Ring Ring - Ring Ring\n..........\nRing Ring - Ring Ring \n..........\n\n-
    Ooh Maria, you picked up. I am glad you did! They\u2019ve broken down Muresean\u2019s
    family house. You know the one next door! You should come settle your family
    home.\r\n\r\nOh I\u2019ll come as soon as I can, thank you for calling me Tanti
    Iana. Are you alright?\r\n\r\n- I am okay nowhere an old lady can go. Just come
    and see for yourself. \n\nAlright then, I'll be right there. \r\n\r\n"
